flowchart TB
    accTitle: Where module-ecommerce-ai fits
    accDescr: A shopper query reaches module-ecommerce-ai. It asks parse-tree to understand the query and to filter the knowledge graph. If that finds nothing it searches document-search. Catalogue sync reads the store's WooCommerce API and writes to parse-tree and document-search; crawl uses search-trainer.
    SH["Shopper query"] --> EAI["module-ecommerce-ai<br>:8096"]:::here
    WC["Store catalogue<br>(WooCommerce REST API)"] -- "/sync" --> EAI
    EAI -- "PTClient" --> PT["package-parse-tree<br>ontology + KG"]
    EAI -- "DSClient" --> DS["package-document-search<br>vectors + keywords"]
    EAI -- "STClient, /crawl" --> ST["package-search-trainer"]
    ST --> DS
    PT --> NEL["package-named-entity-linker"]
